TITLE 1D transport 10 cells 10 shifts with exchange
SOLUTION 0  Infilling
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0
SOLUTION 1-10  Initial
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -lengths 1
    -dispersivities 0
    -diffusion_coefficient 0
    -time_step 1
    -punch_cells 1
    -punch_frequency 1
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.csv
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -simulation true
    -state true
    -step true
    -totals Na Ca Cl
    -pH true
    -ionic_strength true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings SC_uS_cm
    10 PUNCH SC
END
